msgstr "Sàbhail"

msgid "Select 'Yes' to enable add debug output to log."
msgstr "Tagh 'Tha' gus leigeil le toradh deasbaid a chur ris an logadh."

msgid "Select 'Yes' to enable the addition of Weather."
msgstr "Tagh 'Tha' gus an cuir thu Aimsir a-steach."

msgid "Select location"
msgstr "Tagh àite"

msgid "Select the City and Press Ok"
msgstr "Tagh am City and Press Ok"

msgid "Select the detail level in the detail view. You have the choice between a comprehensive presentation in a smaller font and a reduced presentation with a larger font."
msgstr "Tagh an ìre mion-fhiosrachaidh anns an t-sealladh mion-fhiosrachaidh. Tha roghainn agad eadar taisbeanadh coileanta ann an cruth-clò nas lugha agus taisbeanadh nas lugha le cruth-clò nas motha."

msgid "Select the metric unit for wind speed to be used for wind displays. This has no effect on the imperial unit 'mph'."
msgstr "Tagh an aonad meatrach airson astar gaoithe a thèid a chleachdadh airson taisbeanaidhean gaoithe. Chan eil buaidh sam bith aig seo air an aonad ìmpireil 'mph'."

msgid "Select the preferred weather service to supply the weather information."
msgstr "Tagh an t-seirbheis sìde as fheàrr leat gus am fiosrachadh sìde a thoirt seachad."

msgid "Select the temperature unit to be used for temperature displays."
msgstr "Tagh an aonad teòthachd a thèid a chleachdadh airson taisbeanaidhean teòthachd."

msgid "Select this option to save that last obtained weather data locally. This is used to initialize the data immediately after restart while updated data is being fetched."
msgstr "Tagh an roghainn seo gus an dàta sìde mu dheireadh a fhuaireadh gu h-ionadail a shàbhaladh. Tha seo air a chleachdadh gus an dàta a thòiseachadh dìreach às deidh ath-thòiseachadh fhad ‘s a thathas a’ faighinn dàta ùraichte."

