msgstr "Iar-dheas"

msgid "Specify how often Weather retrieves its data from the server. 'Once' means the data will loaded only once after a GUI or system start."
msgstr "Sònraich dè cho tric ‘s a bhios Aimsir a’ faighinn an dàta bhon fhrithealaiche. Tha ‘Aon uair’ a’ ciallachadh nach tèid an dàta a luchdachadh ach aon turas às deidh tòiseachadh GUI no siostam."

